{"id":"n24838-1-2","stage":3,"title":"이러다 · 这么着","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24838-1-2-1","ko":"내가 너무 늦게 왔지? 미안해.","zh":"我来得太晚了，对吧？对不起。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"늦게","meaning":"晚，迟","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64526","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦게","audio":"/audio/f953561284e61df1c157.mp3"}},{"text":"왔지?","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔지","audio":"/audio/30d1e06f5e1b21e898aa.mp3"}},{"text":"미안해.","meaning":"抱歉，对不起，不好意思","explanation":"미안하다：抱歉，对不起，不好意思；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"미안하다","audio":"/audio/a3bb8e6d52d6985107bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67883","senseId":"2","lemma":"미안하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미안해","audio":"/audio/aacbb9c76d03aaf6939d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"64526","definition":"比作为基准的某个时候还慢。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"a3bb8e6d52d69851","term":"미안하다","zh":"抱歉，对不起，不好意思","audio":"/audio/a3bb8e6d52d6985107bb.mp3","entryId":"67883","definition":"谦虚地向对方请求谅解。","pronunciation":["미안하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c9b06dfdce265f3727cd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24838-1-2-2","ko":"다음부터는 절대 이러면 안 돼.","zh":"下次绝对不能再这样了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음부터는","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次；부터：表示起点：“从……起”；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음부터는","audio":"/audio/fadf79ad6d68930569bb.mp3"}},{"text":"절대","meaning":"绝对，绝","explanation":"절대：绝对，绝。","readings":[{"term":"절대","audio":"/audio/0a8790a2dbe122f345a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31702","senseId":"2","lemma":"절대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"절대","audio":"/audio/0a8790a2dbe122f345a3.mp3"}},{"text":"이러면","meaning":"这么着","explanation":"이러다：这么着；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"이러다","audio":"/audio/a42eace37d0e6c1863cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24838","senseId":"1","lemma":"이러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이러면","audio":"/audio/cf730f5a0d8c3f68d139.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"0a8790a2dbe122f3","term":"절대","zh":"绝对，绝","audio":"/audio/0a8790a2dbe122f345a3.mp3","entryId":"31702","definition":"不管在什么情况下都必须。","pronunciation":["절때"]},{"id":"a42eace37d0e6c18","term":"이러다","zh":"这么着","audio":"/audio/a42eace37d0e6c1863cb.mp3","entryId":"24838","definition":"这样做。","pronunciation":["이러다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/747662dd0ce21cfa88dd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24838","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":94,"sequenceScore":2.5235,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我来得太晚了，对吧？对不起。","下次绝对不能再这样了。","铅笔芯怎么老是断啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我来得太晚了，对吧？对不起。","下次绝对不能再这样了。","铅笔芯怎么老是断啊。"],"answer":1}]}
